        "scale": [
          2.3,
          2.3
        ],
        "pivot": [
          0.0,
          0.0
        ],
        "visibility": 1,
        "opacity": 1.0,
        "locked": 0,
        "text": "Try it on the two pictures in the frame. Click one, or drag a box around both. Shift or Ctrl adds to the selection.\n\n1   Corner handles scale (Shift: free, Alt: from the centre). Edge handles stretch.\n2   The round knob above the selection rotates. Hold Shift for 15° steps.\n3   Drag to move. The Attribute Editor holds the exact numbers: position, size, scale and rotation.\n4   The arrow keys nudge (Shift: ×10). Ctrl+Z undoes any change, Ctrl+Shift+Z redoes it.\n\nA small quick-edit bar floats under the selection with its most useful settings.",
        "color": [
          226,
          229,
          235
        ],
        "runs": null,
        "font_family": "",
        "font_size": 14.0,
