        "visibility": 1,
        "opacity": 1.0,
        "locked": 0,
        "text": "You never need to remember a menu. Press Ctrl+K, or right-click the canvas, and type.\n\n1   Type part of a command name, or what it does.\n2   Results show their menu and their shortcut, so you learn the keys as you go.\n\nF1 (or ?) opens the full shortcut list, where you can rebind any key.",
