        ],
        "visibility": 1,
        "opacity": 1.0,
        "locked": 0,
        "text": "A link shows what connects to what, and follows the items when they move. Drag either picture.\n\n1   Press W and drag from one item to another. Ends snap to an item, or pin to a spot on it.\n2   Style it in the Attribute Editor: colour, thickness, dash pattern, straight or curved, arrowheads.\n3   Drag the line itself to add waypoints.\n\nCtrl+L links the selected items in the order you picked them.",
        "color": [
          226,
          229,
          235
        ],
        "runs": null,
        "font_family": "",
        "font_size": 14.0,
